  "_doc": "Words src/search.py reads out of the model's query string, in normalised form (ة→ه, أ→ا, tashkeel stripped). hints: filter/ranking words, never dish names. type_words: a word that names a dish type (salad, drink...) filters to that type. Edit here, not in code; tests/test_search.py pins the behaviour. implies_type: named items whose type picks the alternatives when they are not sold. secondary_markers: words after these name an accompaniment («برجر مع بطاطس»); they rank but are not required. recommend_words: the caller asks her to recommend («وش ترشحين», «جوعان»); an open request that gets the taste, people and budget questions.",
